  "html": "<h2><strong>2.查询可经办的账户列表DCLISACC</strong></h2><p><strong class=\"ql-size-large\">使用场景</strong></p><p>\t当需要查询经办人员可查询或者可经办的账户时，请调用该接口。<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">（该接口只适用支付、代发业务）</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong class=\"ql-size-large\">使用说明</strong></p><p>\t根据提交的用户名、业务类别以及业务模式，返回经办经办人员有权限查询或者经办的账户列表，字段包括币种、分行号、账号、户名以及公司名称。</p><p><br></p><p><strong class=\"ql-size-large\">请求报文</strong></p><div class=\"quill-better-table-wrapper\"><table class=\"quill-better-table\" style=\"width: 500px;\"><colgroup><col width=\"100\" class=\"ql-align-center\"><col width=\"100\" class=\"ql-align-center\"><col width=\"100\" class=\"ql-align-center\"><col width=\"100\" class=\"ql-align-center\"><col width=\"100\" class=\"ql-align-center\"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-row=\"1\"><td data-row=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" data-cell-bg=\"rgb(218, 238, 243)\" style=\"background-color: rgb(218, 238, 243);\"><p class=\"qlbt-cell-line ql-align-center\" data-row=\"1\" data-cell=\"1\" data-rowspan=\"1\" data-colspan=\"1\" data-cell-bg=\"rgb(218, 238, 243)\"><strong>字段名称</strong></p></td><td data-row=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" data-cell-bg=\"rgb(218, 238, 243)\" style=\"background-color: rgb(218, 238, 243);\"><p class=\"qlbt-cell-line ql-align-center\" data-row=\"1\" data-cell=\"2\" data-rowspan=\"1\" data-colspan=\"1\" data-cell-bg=\"rgb(218, 238, 243)\"><strong>字段ID</strong></p></td><td data-row=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" data-cell-bg=\"rgb(218, 238, 243)\" style=\"background-color: rgb(218, 238, 243);\"><p class=\"qlbt-cell-line ql-align-center\" data-row=\"1\" data-cell=\"3\" data-rowspan=\"1\" data-colspan=\"1\" data-cell-bg=\"rgb(218, 238, 243)\"><strong>数据类型</strong></p></td><td data-row=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" data-cell-bg=\"rgb(218, 238, 243)\" style=\"background-color: rgb(218, 238, 243);\"><p class=\"qlbt-cell-line ql-align-center\" data-row=\"1\" data-cell=\"4\" data-rowspan=\"1\" data-colspan=\"1\" data-cell-bg=\"rgb(218, 238, 243)\"><strong